# Terraform GCP/Firebase (core) root local files.
#
# Mirrors terraform/posthog/.gitignore so each root owns its own local-files
# rules; the umbrella terraform/README.md documents the overall layout. The
# provider lock file (.terraform.lock.hcl) is intentionally committed so CI and
# local dev validate against identical provider versions and hashes.

.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
terraform.tfvars
env/*.tfvars
!env/*.tfvars.example
backend/*.hcl
!backend/*.hcl.example
